- patches/ contains unified diffs against PhoneBox 0.6.9 (commit 620c904). Applying them produces a
  modified PhoneBox; the PhoneBox MIT license and copyright notice continue to apply to those sources.
- agent/ is an independent Rust implementation of the PhoneBox 0.6.9 desktop-agent HTTP/SSE contract.
  Its contract fixtures (agent/tests/fixtures/) record response *shapes* of PhoneBox 0.6.9.
- apk/ builds the PhoneBox Android project from upstream source; it contains no upstream code.
